### 1. Crear Cancion 1
POST http://localhost:8084/api/canciones
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Bohemian Rhapsody",
  "artista": "Queen",
  "album": "A Night at the Opera",
  "genero": "Rock",
  "duracionSegundos": 354
}

